@startuml
left to right direction

rectangle "Player\n玩家" as Player
rectangle "Enemy\n敵人" as Enemy
rectangle "GameManager\n管理分數與血量" as GameManager
rectangle "HUD\nHealthHUD / Fruit Icons" as HUD
rectangle "RayCast2D\n平台邊緣偵測" as RayCast
rectangle "TileMap / Wall\n平台與牆面" as World

Player -[hidden]-> GameManager
GameManager -[hidden]-> HUD
RayCast -[hidden]down-> Enemy
World -[hidden]down-> Player

Enemy --> Player : a1 讀取位置做追蹤判定
Enemy --> Player : a2 讀取水平 / 垂直距離做攻擊判定
Enemy --> Player : a3 攻擊時呼叫 take_damage
Player --> GameManager : a4 呼叫 set_health
GameManager --> HUD : a5 更新血量顯示

note right of Player
  攻擊分支
  a1 -> a2 -> a3 -> a4 -> a5
end note

RayCast --> Enemy : b1 回報前方是否仍有地板
Enemy --> Enemy : b2 無地板時反轉 direction

World --> Enemy : c1 撞牆時 is_on_wall() 為 true
Enemy --> Enemy : c2 反轉 direction

legend right
  |= Flow |= 說明 |
  | a | 敵人讀取玩家位置，進入攻擊後讓玩家扣血並更新 HUD |
  | b | 巡邏 / 追蹤時，因前方沒有地板而轉向 |
  | c | 巡邏 / 追蹤時，因撞牆而轉向 |
endlegend
@enduml
